        "id": "2111538525568930162",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Yuri Bezmenov's Ghost",
        "text": "To be demoralized is to have your sense of reality so inverted that you fail to recognize you are in a state of war, mistake those attacking you for victims, and willingly assist them in undermining your own society while believing you are doing something good.",
